* CSD18533KCS  60 V N-channel NexFET power MOSFET (Texas Instruments)
* Datasheet-based model for ngspice (VDMOS). NOT the vendor model.
* Source: docs/datasheets/csd18533kcs.pdf (SLPS362D), typical values at 25 C.
* See prototype1/README.md for how each parameter was derived.
*
* Pins: drain gate source
.subckt CSD18533KCS d g s
M1 d g s CSD18533KCS_DS
.model CSD18533KCS_DS VDMOS(
+ vto=1.9  kp=150  lambda=0
+ rd=2.3m  rs=2.0m  rg=1.4
+ cgs=2413p  cgdmin=7p  cgdmax=2000p  a=0.9
+ cjo=3.9n  vj=1.5  m=0.85
+ is=9e-10  n=1  rb=2m  bv=60  ibv=250u )
.ends CSD18533KCS
